00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.160
Shbwaa!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:20.160
SHBWA                                            AAAAAAAA!

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:23.290
S-Sylphyn! You're already in line?

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.000
And I've bought popcorn for everyone!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.290
We were talking about getting something to eat first...

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:31.540
Shwaaaat?

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:33.080
SHWAAAAAT?

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.080
Y-you were?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.700
Sylphyn, I swear...

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:42.620
U-um, maybe we COULD see the movie first.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:43.160
Huh?

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:47.200
Recent Releases

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:51.040
There sure are a lot of movies out, huh?

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:51.040
Which one should we see?

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.620
The Fisherman and the Tuna

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:55.040
That hasn't come out yet. 

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.290
It's so sweet and delicious!

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:58.580
I can't stop eating it!

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:03.000
They all look good... it's hard to choose one, isn't it?

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.830
"Master Detective Nacon" seems pretty popular. 

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.790
Whoa! 4.5 stars!

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:13.700
I used to watch Nacon when I was in elementary school.

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:16.330
I would like to see Precuare!

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:18.370
Wow! You already bought the promotional booklet!

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:20.750
That caters to an even younger audience...

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:24.040
Okay everyone, let's all raise our voices!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.250
Precuare!

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:29.040
I think I'd be a little embarrassed...

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:33.500
What? But I spent last night watching

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:33.500
the old shows and practicing for this.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:37.330
So long as I can be with the Master...

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:37.330
I'm totally fine with this. 

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:40.750
Let's just go with what everyone wants to watch.  

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.700
I will see Precuare with UMR later!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:44.290
Huh?

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:45.370
