00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.500
Is it a DJ?

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.540
This is comfy indeed!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.410
Huh? What happened to the popcorn?

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.250
We were lucky to find such good seats.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:58.410
I never thought the four of us would be

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:58.410
hanging out and watching a movie...

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:02.160
Still, I'm glad we were all able to become friends.  

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.580
A-are you okay, Kirie?

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:17.620
I-I'm fine! I'm just a little scared of the dark.

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:17.620
But I'll be all right. Please, enjoy the movie! 

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:19.580
Sorry, but I will...

